  "prompt": "How does the signup funnel convert in each country, for the users who signed up in 2025? A user counts as activated with a first_campaign_sent event, and as paid with at least one payment, refunded or not; a user counts at a step only when the user also reached the step before, at any time. signup_ts is a UTC instant, read in UTC. Return six columns, in this order: country_code, signed_up, activated, activation_rate (activated over signed_up), paid and paid_rate (paid over activated), each rate a fraction between 0 and 1; paid_rate is missing for a country with no activated user. Return one row for each country with a 2025 signup. Any row order is fine.",
